   <description>RETESTED 9/24/2026: the 9/17 finding below was stale. New UI's postal code field (#registration-postalCode) now rejects an oversized value with an inline error ("Please enter a valid postal code") on blur — confirmed live. Automated below. Original 9/17 note, kept for history: "entered a 42-character value, it was accepted with no error and no truncation (maxLength attribute is -1, unset)." Old UI enforces a 15-character max via HTML maxlength; new UI's mechanism is a format-validation message instead, not a hard character cap — see TC_Registration_InvalidPostalCode_OldUI for the old UI equivalent.</description>
